<% set_page_meta title: "Contact", description: "Reach SPEERD by email, Instagram, or TikTok about light, fabrication, or an ambitious object." %>

<main id="main-content">
  <header class="contact-hero accent--spectacle">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1><%= portfolio_catalog.site.fetch("invitation") %></h1>
    <p>I’m interested in LED installations, instrument collaborations, unusual fabrication problems, and projects that need more than one kind of making.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="contact-details" aria-labelledby="contact-details-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Good starting points</p>
      <h2 id="contact-details-title">Tell me what it should feel like.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Useful first messages include the object or space, the people using it, the rough timeline, and what success looks like. Sketches and improbable references are welcome.</p>
      <%= mail_to site_email, "Send the idea", subject: "Project inquiry", class: "button-link button-link--dark" %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-routes" aria-labelledby="contact-routes-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Every way in</p>
    <h2 id="contact-routes-title">Three doors.</h2>
    <ul class="contact-routes__list">
      <li class="contact-route spectrum--1">
        <p class="eyebrow">Email</p>
        <%= mail_to site_email, subject: "Project inquiry", class: "contact-route__link" %>
        <p class="contact-route__note">Commissions, collaborations, and anything with a timeline. This is the one I answer properly.</p>
      </li>
      <% [
        [ "Instagram", portfolio_catalog.site.fetch("instagram"), "Work in progress, finished pieces, and the occasional honest failure. DMs are open for a quick question." ],
        [ "TikTok", portfolio_catalog.site.fetch("tiktok"), "The same shop in motion, and considerably shorter." ]
      ].each_with_index do |(network, url, note), index| %>
        <li class="contact-route <%= spectrum_class(index + 3) %>">
          <p class="eyebrow"><%= network %></p>
          <%= link_to social_handle(url), url, class: "contact-route__link", rel: "me noopener", target: "_blank" %>
          <p class="contact-route__note"><%= note %></p>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
    <p class="contact-routes__footnote">The handle is a leftover from a bench that only made rings. It is all of it now — light, costume, and steel.</p>
  </section>
</main>
